; ==============================================================================
; ASCII Canvas & Box Diagram Drawing Example (in zago Editor LOGO)
; ==============================================================================
; Demonstrates ASCII canvas primitives: `SETBORDERSTYLE`, `SETARROWSTYLE`,
; `BOX`, `LINE`, `VLINE`.
; ==============================================================================

TYPE "===_ASCII_Drawing_&_Diagram_Demo_==="
NL
TYPE CHAR 10

; 1. Draw Web Server Box (Double Border)
BOX 24 4 "API_Gateway"

; 2. Connect vertical line
VLINE 2

; 3. Draw Database Cluster Box (Rounded Border)
BOX 24 4 "Database_Node" "round"

; 4. Horizontal separator line
LINE 24
